/v1/","context":{"app_id":4809140,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4809140","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:49:39Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5083160","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1846651706693370","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"announcement","title":"Mygohome is Now in Steam Next Fest October! Launching in November","summary":"Hello everyone! I'm the developer of Mygohome. Steam Next Fest October (Oct 19 - 26) has officially begun! I'm thrilled that Mygohome is part of this event and hope it helps more indie game fans discover the game. 🎮 What kind of game is this? Mygohome is a fully hand-drawn, anime-style survival horror game. You need to monitor anomalies around you, manage your sanity (SAN), and use various unique survival items to deal with danger. When facing sudden monster attacks, you can try to parry at the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693370","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1846651706684206","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.5 Update: View Tutorials Anytime & Full Audio Optimization!","summary":"Added a \"Beginner Tutorial\" button to the death and settings screens. Remastered the main menu BGM and character voice acting. Optimized the tutorial text. Hope you have a better experience.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:39:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684206","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1844115010503022","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.4 Major Update: Difficulty Rebalancing, New Monster Ambush Animations, H","summary":"Hello everyone! Thank you for playtesting and sharing your feedback over this period. Based on valuable community suggestions, we've just uploaded Demo v1.4—our biggest update yet!🔧 Core Balance and Experience ImprovementsSignificantly reduced overall difficulty: You now have more opportunities in the early game to get used to the mechanics.Improved monster mechanics: Added an animation for the monster's ambush state. You can now see the moment before the monster enters the room on the monitor, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T03:36:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1842212951298610","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"announcement","title":"Mygohome Free Demo Now Available","summary":"Demo now available!Hello everyone, I'm the developer of Mygohome.After a long period of development and testing, the free demo is now officially live on Steam.The demo includes the first three nights of the game, where you can experience:· Basic monitoring and survival gameplay· The thunderstorm and lightning event on Night 2· The new monster Chariot on Night 3, along with the key item \"Crown\"· The story and NPC interactions of the first three nights· Multiple hidden items (change your appearanc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T02:06:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1840944183788207","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"announcement","title":"2D Hand-Drawn Survival Horror Demo Coming Soon — Major Optimization Updates ！","summary":"Hello everyone!First, I want to thank every player who participated in the Playtest again. Your feedback has helped me enormously.I'm happy to announce that the official Demo will launch at the end of this month. The Demo will include the game's first three nights and the corresponding daydream scenes.Compared to the Playtest version, this Demo includes the following updates:Difficulty ImprovementsThe difficulty of Nights 1 and 2 has been greatly reduced, so new players can get familiar with the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T08:55:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1839041357033168","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"announcement","title":"《迷家mygohome》Second Playtest – Now Live!","summary":"🌙 1. Three Full Nights – Not Just One!Before, you could only play the first night. Now the story goes all the way to the third night! Each night brings new enemies, new mechanics, and tougher survival challenges – way more gameplay and story to explore.🛠️ 2. New Item System + 4 Brand-New ItemsEach item can only be used once per night, but don't worry – all your item uses reset at the start of every night! So plan carefully when to use them. We've also added 4 new items with different effects – y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T03:53:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033168","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4809140-1836506165544797","game_id":"steam-4809140","kind":"announcement","title":"First Playtest Now Live","summary":"This test includes only the prologue and the first night of the full game (the full game will feature six nights in total). Localization and basic auto-save are fully implemented. We hope you enjoy it!If you encounter any bugs or have suggestions, please leave a comment below.Thank you so much for your support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T03:49:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165544797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4809140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4809140":"2026-10-26T04:25:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4809140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5083160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4809140","app_id":4809140,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:58Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c3ec6053b0b359a118cc3d3de4398f344faad8e61559133eedd8a4ecfde3614c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"귀여운 핸드드로잉 세계에서 그리 귀엽지 않은 밤을 보내세요. 캐릭터를 조작해 직접 방을 지키며 괴물, 문, 창문과 계속 떨어지는 SAN 수치 사이에서 살아남을 길을 찾아야 합니다. 매일 밤 새로운 위험이 찾아오고, 날이 밝은 후에는 더 많은 비밀이 기다리고 있습니다